title: MikroTik REST API: Memory
agents: mikrotik_rest_api
catalog: hw/network/mikrotik
license: GPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Main memory usage of a MikroTik RouterOS device ({total-memory} and
 {free-memory} of {/system/resource}). Levels via the rule {Main memory
 usage of simple devices with single services}, percent used (default
 WARN at 80%, CRIT at 90%) or absolute free memory.

 To connect to the MikroTik device a special datasource program is
 used: {MikroTik RouterOS (mikrotik-rest-api)} in Setup > Agents >
 Other integrations, module "RouterOS Info, CPU, memory, system disk,
 uptime".

 Added in mikrotik-rest-api 1.0.0 by Klaus Paulitsch.

perfdata:
 Used memory in percent and bytes, total memory.

inventory:
 One service.
